Cell["\<\
The head h can be  RightContract (\[RightContract]), LeftContract (\
\[LeftContract]), InnerProduct (\[InnerProduct]), CommutativeProduct (\
\[CommutativeProduct]), OuterProduct (\[OuterProduct]) or  GeometricProduct (\
\[GeometricProduct]).\
\>", "Notes",
