Cell["\<\
We see that in the last result all coefficients were expanded, whereas in the \
first result it was kept \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]as \
is\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. Therefore the answer of first expansion became \
longer. They both coincide after expansion \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9606099903277063`*^9, 3.960610158271434*^9}},
